/--
Positive-part Duhamel production bridge.

Selecting the positive part of the Duhamel source before payoff can defeat the
signed-cancellation toy only if that positive part also gives a strict
above-threshold production estimate.  A quadratic reserve measure by itself is
not this bridge.
-/
structure DuhamelPositivePartProductionGainBridge
    {seq : LerayHopfSequence} {K : CompactSubCylinder}
