/--
Projection of the channel-separation and same-carrier budget fields inside a
C7 packing owner-preimage receipt.

This is ergonomic plumbing, not a new obstruction: the mathematical work is
constructing `C7PackingOwnerPreimageReceipt` or the upstream
`C7OwnerPreimageGeometryCoreReceipt`.  The projection exists so downstream
consumers cannot use only the numerical owner-preimage prefix and forget the
production, pressure, partition, section-identity, no-reuse, and same-carrier
owner-budget fields already required by the receipt.
