Bridge witness for the flat-radius side of the upstream-closure bundle.

Symmetric to the pressure bridge: a Prop assertion that a flat-radius
scale-reserve primitive supplies the negation of
`flatRadiusScaleReserveFailure`.  Bundle requires this as a hypothesis;
producing it is the remaining flat-radius PDE obligation.
